{"name": "Loco: Rails & Tails", "description": "<div class=\"game_area_description\" id=\"game_area_description\">\n<h2>About This Game</h2>\n<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" crossorigin=\"anonymous\" height=\"638\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3576920/extras/c50df10467e7a21ae588bb9a717a5f8f.poster.avif?t=1787599062\" width=\"1170\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3576920/extras/c50df10467e7a21ae588bb9a717a5f8f.webm?t=1787599062\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Loco is a chaotic co-op Adventure for 1-4 players that you can play online or in classic local style.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Work together as a team to ensure the train will arrive at next station on time and with all expected cargo.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Fight bandits, gather resources and create items in 4 biomes full of hand crafted levels. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Classic race against time with extra fighting mechanic on the top.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Whether you have a cannon, a gatling gun or simply your bare fists, protect the train from various dangerous and thieving thugs.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" crossorigin=\"anonymous\" height=\"658\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3576920/extras/d97fda3232fa9be80baf8b81985c7f02.poster.avif?t=1787599062\" width=\"1170\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3576920/extras/d97fda3232fa9be80baf8b81985c7f02.webm?t=1787599062\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Online and local co-op<strong>.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Synchonize with your team and try out new strategies to beat your time and earn medals.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" crossorigin=\"anonymous\" height=\"638\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3576920/extras/bb993f1638aa6f24fd9389d420fd3448.poster.avif?t=1787599062\" width=\"1170\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3576920/extras/bb993f1638aa6f24fd9389d420fd3448.webm?t=1787599062\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/></video></span></p> </div>", "short_desc": "Chaotic co-op for 1\u20134 players! Build rails, protect the train and deliver cargo on time. Pick your favourite animal hero and embark with your friends on wild west adventure!", "header_image": "https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3576920/f8b18a4127cfc03739bf999ace901681a981c598/header.jpg?t=1787599062", "screenshots": [], "tags": ["Multiplayer", "Casual", "Co-op", "Online Co-Op", "Local Multiplayer", "Trains"], "developers": "Hot Potato Games", "publishers": "Hot Potato Games", "release_date": "2026", "price": "Coming Soon", "appid": "3576920", "review_type": "Informational", "curator_desc": "19 July 2026 - Request Access", "yt_link": "https://youtu.be/QHb1IAyq8Ig", "first_seen": 1784419200.0}